            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Land it Rocket</strong> is a challenging yet accessible 2D rocket-landing game inspired by classic lunar landers.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills across <strong>28 carefully crafted levels</strong>, navigating narrow passages, avoiding hazards, and perfecting your landing technique.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're chasing high scores or just want to relax and land safely, there's a mode for you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 🚀 28 handcrafted levels with increasing difficulty  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 🌌 Endless Mode for unlimited challenge  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 🎮 Full controller support – plug and play  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- ✨ Simple controls, clean visuals, smooth performance  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for fans of physics-based platformers, retro challenges, and relaxing gameplay loops.</p>",
